  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Standard?\n\nI'm not clear on if and when each state override is valid, but I noticed that the [opaque path state](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#cannot-be-a-base-url-path-state) doesn't reject, remove, or change trailing space literals. I first noticed this being an issue in the Rust URL crate (https://github.com/servo/rust-url/issues/1123) and am unsure if the crate or spec is wrong here.",
